      48.02,
      561.95,
      286.64,
      647.15
    ],
    "text": "All that allotment of land, in total extent of about 0.0030 Hectare, depicted as Lot No. 01 in the Cad. Map No. 522227, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Awissawella, in Seethawaka Grama Niladhari Division, 432/B, in Hewagam Koralaya Minor Division, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Seethawaka (Hanwella) in Colombo District, Western Province and bounded as follows :",
