    "text": "M. Lalanthi, M. Sumanawathi, R. P. Gunawathi, M.Pemananda, I. M. Seelawathi, Piyal Mudannayake,Deepani Renuka Weerasinghe (for M. Thomas and M.Symon), M .Chandrasena, Y. M. Ranjith, M.W.D.Jayamanna and Gunendra Pathma Jayantha residing atHalthotawatta Awissawella; Extent: 0.0030 Hectare.",
