      548.61
    ],
    "text": "All persons who claim ownership, interest or any other connection to the aforesaid Land hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me on 07th July 2025 at 10.00 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat, Seethawaka.",
